&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・豪雨等発生時における事業継続（他事業所からの後方支援等）のための綿密な行動計画の立案&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・人的被害を食い止め、事業継続への影響の最小化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17.9pt;min-height:17.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;物理&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（急性/慢性）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;サイクロンや洪水などの異常気象の重大性と頻度の上昇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;気象パターンの極端な変動&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;顧客が立地する特定の地域で水害・雪害等の発生頻度が増加すると、自然災害を回避するために、顧客の工場・事務所等が災害危険エリアから移転することにより、顧客を失い、売上の損失につながる。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・自然災害に影響されない設備（受変電設備の高所設置、融雪設備等）を提案し、顧客の移転抑制&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17.9pt;min-height:17.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;物理&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（慢性）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;平均気温の上昇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;夏場における気温上昇によって、空調設備の能力不足が発生し、各事業所の空調設備の能力増強のための改修が必要となり、改修費の負担が生じる。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;中&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;中&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・計画的な設備投資により、空調設備の能力増強の段階的実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17.9pt;min-height:17.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;物理&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（慢性）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;平均気温の上昇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;夏場における気温上昇によって、ヒートストレスが増加することで労働生産性が低下し工事遅延などの発生により、投入人員数を増加させる必要が生じ、人件費等の事業コストが増加する。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;中&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;中&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・暑さ対策に向けた労働環境の整備（空調服の導入拡大等）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※１　現状よりも厳しい対策が取られる世界観（２℃以下）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※２　現状を上回る温暖化対策が取られない世界観&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;＜機会＞&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;シナリオ分析の結果、社会やお客さまの低炭素ニーズに合った製品の提供、気候変動への適応に向けたサービスの提供などが、当社の業績に大きな影響を与える可能性があると特定した。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:484pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:50pt;min-width:50pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:60pt;min-width:60pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:127pt;min-width:127pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:30pt;min-width:30pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:30pt;min-width:30pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:30pt;min-width:30pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:30pt;min-width:30pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:127pt;min-width:127pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17.9pt;min-height:17.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" rowspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;TCFDの定める機会の種類&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;当社が推定する機会の概要&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="4" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;当社への影響度&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;"&gt;機会獲得のための対応策&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
